{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model using scvi_n200 encoder with singleprofile setting, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5203 and F1 score of 0.4982. These results indicate scvi_n200 improves performance compared to PCA-based encoders (config_001), but multiprofile configurations (e.g., config_002, 004) still outperform singleprofile with scvi_n200. The exact contribution of profile setting versus other factors remains uncertain due to limited comparative evidence."
}

